{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_chen2_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_chen2_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "歸屬",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_chen2_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2b167c581b8227cd09ba247d53496fb3232d5b25486537d0f7991245db0384db",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G01"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G02"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bar_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bar_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視台主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位觀眾，市民們，遊客們，還有我們通過了海選的正式選手們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視台主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如何，各位昨天晚上睡得好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視台主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我可算是睡了個好覺，托選手們的福，之前輸在賭場的錢這下可全回來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視台主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感謝我押中的那幾位選手，沒有你們，就沒有我昨天的好夢，但先說好，我可不會給你們分成！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視台主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，廢話不多說，昨天的海選雖然已經足夠精彩，但接下來才是多索雷斯極限大賽真正的看點所在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視台主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在接下來兩天短暫的休息時間之後，正式賽馬上就要敲響賽鐘，這次的參賽者看點多多，接下來的精彩瞬間回顧不容錯過！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視台主持人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來吧！讓我們來看看這些通過海選的選手們的精彩表現——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行了，這主持人看著我就生氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天那個海選差點讓我把腿都摔斷了，結果最後還不是被淘汰出局！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瘋了吧，我下的注全打水漂了，這次可虧慘了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道你是給自己下的注？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼可能，我看起來這麼傻？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我押的可是前幾屆有名的選手，還指望至少能有一兩個闖到決賽，結果這幫混球居然全都在海選被刷了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我最看好的那個小隊，居然被兩個突然冒出來的小姑娘打趴下了，開什麼玩笑，我可是砸了一百萬在他們身上欸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哦？是什麼人這麼厲害？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個小隊叫什麼來著，叫什麼鼠......鼠什麼的，反正是個怪名字的隊伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能是賊眉鼠眼吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，好像也不至於這麼罵人......算了，記不清了，總之真是氣死我了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，別生氣了。喝酒嗎？這杯我請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼好？那真是謝謝了，美女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過......奇怪，我怎麼覺得你有點眼熟，我們是不是在哪見過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，錯覺吧。我才剛到這座城市沒多久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（眼熟是肯定的，畢竟就是我把你的一百萬用拳頭撂倒了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（還好出門前做了點偽裝，埃內斯托那小子說有半城人看了昨天的直播，看來不是誇大其詞......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過確實是怪事一樁，往期的有名選手居然連海選都過不去，這種事應該不常見吧？是不是讓很多人都賠了一筆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可不是，昨天沒人跳樓都是奇跡了。莊家這筆肯定賺翻了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......打假賽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然還能是什麼？集體走霉運嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然這事本身不算稀奇啦，往年也不是沒有，但......呃，怎麼說呢，今年不太一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這大賽我也不是第一回參加了，雖說每屆都有一大批新人湊熱鬧，但總歸還是有不少熟面孔，還能弄個熱門選手排行什麼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果今年奇奇怪怪的新隊伍尤其多，氣氛好像也有點怪怪的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（果然......這次大賽有什麼地方不對勁。我猜得沒錯，對方一定不會放過這場大賽這麼好的機會。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這些隊伍裡，不知道有多少人心懷鬼胎，伺機作亂。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不行，只靠這些還沒辦法斷定。還有今天工業區倉庫那裡......本來還以為會有線索，結果竟然被人搶先。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（追著那些人，只能查到這個酒吧。到底是什麼人搶在我前面解決了他們，也還不清楚......嘖，還需要更多情報。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真不知道賽制組在搞什麼，這幫混蛋私下裡收了多少好處......喂喂，你在聽我說嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？啊，我聽著呢，今年確實挺亂來的，海選好像也有不少人受傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的腿現在還在疼呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每一屆都有很多人受傷嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種比賽嘛，在所難免的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這還不算什麼，我跟你說啊，這裡就是這個風格！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種風格的娛樂都市不算多見，特別是在玻利瓦爾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再聊點什麼吧，關於多索雷斯的事什麼都行，我還想在這裡好好觀光觀光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我請客，我們一起再喝一杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——哈！果然還是直接拿瓶喝爽快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說，你也喝了不少了吧，一點都沒醉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，有點暈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的？我怎麼覺得你看起來還是很冷靜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "職業原因，過去練過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這點不算什麼，我有個朋友，能喝到讓我懷疑她肝臟是不是變異了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的假的，強啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的，而且她還很會說場面話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼聲音，怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉漢A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_205",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？你說什麼你這混蛋？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉漢A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_205",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有種你再說一遍？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉漢B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_195",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說就說，怕你嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉漢B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_195",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說你們那破店已經完蛋了！運氣好能過海選又怎麼樣，還指望拿獎勵的純金雕像賣錢來還債？這點錢連本金都不夠還！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉漢B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_195",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錢還學人去賭？省省吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉漢A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_205",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "***！我宰了你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉漢B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_195",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，要打架隨時奉陪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，這都沒人管嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，等等，別急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還要等什麼，難道真的要等他們打出事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，這些人不傻，不會真的鬧出事情來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果在酒吧裡鬧事還能全身而退，多索雷斯就不會是現在這個樣子，每年能有這麼多遊客了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "酒吧自己有人手能解決？這種事很常見？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差不多。不新鮮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的治安官呢？警察......衛隊之類的機構呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？沒出人命的話用不著這些吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這就是多索雷斯的風格？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（那個坎黛拉·桑切斯就是這麼治理自己的城市的？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......果然還是看不順眼。就不該同意來這裡度假，這地方和我完全合不來。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉漢B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_195",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，怎麼樣，服不服！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉漢B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_195",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能把店面都拿去抵押作賭金，還裝什麼好人，我呸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉漢A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_205",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚，呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉漢A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_205",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能，不能拿走我的店！那是我的所有，是我的命根子，我不能離開這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉漢A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_205",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "求你，求你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_194",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩位客人，請不要在店內......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉漢B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_195",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，沒錢就別學人家裝闊氣！這可是你從前和我說過的，怎麼樣，風水輪流轉，現在這句話就還給你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉漢B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_195",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老兄，滾吧！多索雷斯不歡迎窮鬼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，下手真狠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，等下，這都見血了，真的沒問題嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "住手！都給我停下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，嚇死我了，沒想到你這人還這麼有正義感？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過多管這種閒事會惹麻煩上身哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無所謂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒怕過麻煩。一般來說，是麻煩怕我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇哦，這話聽著真帥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳。實話實說而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不說這個。你剛剛說這種事酒吧會處理，可我看老闆一個人好像處理不來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，這麼說來還真是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老闆，你家雇的那些小夥子呢？剛剛怎麼都不見人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_194",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不巧，今天輪班的正好不在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是出了什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_194",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼大事，那幾個小子昨天也過了海選，手裡有錢了，估計是去哪花天酒地去了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_194",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近這段時間這些小子都不好好上班，我遲早炒了他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近這段時間都......是為了準備這次的大賽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_194",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可就說不準了。這些年輕人，在這地方鬧出什麼事都不奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老闆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_194",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天兩位幫了大忙了，再喝點什麼嗎？算我帳上，也算是我的一點小心意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好耶！老闆大氣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（保鏢曠工，結果又可能和大賽有關？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（巧合？不，這不會只是個巧合......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（再這樣旁敲側擊也問不出什麼了，不知道林雨霞那邊有沒有查到什麼有用的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝，酒我就不用了，不過是舉手之勞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，不喝了？啊，你是準備要去觀光？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那玩得開心點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多索雷斯確實是個好地方啊，只要有錢，什麼好東西都能享受到，從早玩到晚都沒問題，而且還沒人在你耳邊囉嗦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看你好像很喜歡這座城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？沒錯啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你有沒有考慮過定居這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "定居這裡？你......莫非很討厭我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒這回事，開個玩笑而已......等等，為什麼會這麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可不好笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "定居還是算了吧，多索雷斯雖然適合度假，但正經過日子還是不行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也看到這裡什麼狀態了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將來我要是有了小孩，肯定也不想他在這學會白天喝酒晚上賭錢，最後長成個敗家子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白天喝酒。就像你我現在這樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還真沒錯，就像我們現在這樣。我爸媽就叫我敗家子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我倒沒被這麼叫過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我的......長輩。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_o"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bar_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒太多當敗家子的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你過得真累。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我家長是個老頑固，老婆拋下他回娘家之後一直自暴自棄，又酗酒又賭錢，最近還有點謝頂，不像樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他靠不住，我得養家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且在我戰鬥課程全科拿到優之後，就沒人再敢找我的麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實。看你剛剛“勸架”的樣子，又狠又俐落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪，我還是覺得你有點眼熟，特別是剛剛你給那個醉漢的那一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......咳咳，錯覺。別多想了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也是......說真的，如果是放在從前，誰告訴我說能來多索雷斯定居，那我肯定要高興瘋了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這說法可和你剛剛堅決不想在這定居的說辭不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "體諒一下吧，雖然剛剛我是那麼說，但這裡可是玻利瓦爾人夢裡的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每一個玻利瓦爾人都嚮往能住進多索雷斯，所有人都削尖了腦袋要往這裡鑽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看這裡的日子，哈哈，哪能想到外頭還那麼亂啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冒昧問一句，你是玻利瓦爾人沒錯吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算是吧。不過幾年前我家被戰爭毀了，只能遷居......那裡現在還是戰區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來大家還想試試能不能遷到多索雷斯，但我們那時候沒錢，連城門都沒進成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後？然後我們只能繼續向東邊逃，沒想到最後到了哥倫比亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當時沒人知道哥倫比亞是個什麼地方，但那裡確實沒有戰爭，能安穩地住下來......接著生活越來越好，還賺到了點錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在多索雷斯再也不會拒絕我進城了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它不再拒絕你了，但你對它的感情也變了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能是這樣沒錯，這沒辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（土地，和在土地上生活的人......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（像多索雷斯這樣的城市，聚集著這麼多人，卻又拒絕了那麼多人。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（到頭來，這裡又是屬於誰的城？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，你皺眉了。怎麼，覺得這樣不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不會。我只是在想一些事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還不太瞭解玻利瓦爾，也不瞭解多索雷斯。我在這裡看到的還不夠多，很難理解為什麼人們對此趨之若鶩，為什麼這樣不願意離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想輕率地評論。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼突然這麼正經......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不算很正經，隨便說說而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "批評不是難事。但否定之後給不出更好的建議，就顯得輕率且不負責任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只能說......在我看來，這裡確實不算是一座很好的城市，至少和我的性格不符，我覺得它本應可以更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......其實外人怎麼想都正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是對於玻利瓦爾人來說，這裡確實已經很好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還記得我小時候，有次半夜睡著，一群自稱反抗軍的傢伙直接闖進我家......雖然人沒出事，但把我們一家都嚇壞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是內亂......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差不多吧，我其實不太分得清打來打去的那幾波人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之托這些人的福，戰區範圍越來越大，田地和房子都沒了，我們什麼都沒有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玻利瓦爾大多數人都和我們一樣。隨時可能失去一切，朝不保夕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我好像有點理解了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰都沒法保證個人的衣食，穩定的住所隨時受到威脅，勞有所得只是個奢望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這樣的情況下有個地方能讓人活得像個人，那裡一定就是個好地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多索雷斯對於玻利瓦爾人來說，就是這樣的好地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，差不多就是這麼回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是撞了大運，如果沒有誤打誤撞離開玻利瓦爾，多索雷斯現在可能依然還是我心中的天國。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那現在呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算是現在，我也還是喜歡這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "介意說說為什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不為什麼。這裡確實適合度假，還有......大概就是......玻利瓦爾人總要有個盼頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果當初真的留下，你能想像現在自己過著什麼樣的日子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那可就說不準了......搞不好就和剛剛的醉漢一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "努力留在城裡，打工存錢或者靠賭錢大賺一筆，然後可能很快就全部花出去。畢生夙願就是在這裡開個小店......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有點難想像。搞不好我已經不能算是真正的玻利瓦爾人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我問你你是哪裡人的時候，你會怎麼回答我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我當然是......玻利瓦爾人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你不算玻利瓦爾人，怎麼會在這裡，在這種話題上和我說這麼多，連酒都顧不上喝一口？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "單純的外地遊客可不會有這個興致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你這人真會說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎？我經常被朋友說，只有罵人的時候才特別牙尖嘴利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別太謙虛。你說大道理也不差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，謝謝誇獎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天很開心，我差不多該走了，有機會再見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哥倫比亞......我聽說過那邊的司法制度，聽起來還不錯，之後我可能會找時間去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歡迎！你真要來的話，我還可以請你喝杯咖啡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道玻利瓦爾有個咖啡的牌子很有名嗎？我們家招待客人都會用那個，你來哥倫比亞的話，我可以請你喝個夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，有機會的話我一定去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "禮尚往來，還你請的這杯酒和這些話而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_201",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，還沒問你呢，你是哪裡人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龍門。我來自龍門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也是個很不錯的地方，不輸多索雷斯。下次如果再有度假的機會，建議你可以去那裡轉轉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相信我，龍門不會讓你失望的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
